                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Opinion of the inhabitants of Delft about various aspects of living in the city and local information services. Satisfaction with living area / awareness of city council plans / is r. prepared to be active locally / retourette / second-hand shop / attitude towards recycling of rubbish and appliances, furniture etc. / satisfaction with inner city and living area / being bothered by, attitude towards pollution, rubbish, noise / satisfaction with cleanliness in area / does r. ever visit a cemetery if it were a park / crime, feelings of unsafety / weekly markets</p>"
